{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion", "comment_count": 5, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_061", "text": "15800的儿童车，成本可能不到2000，剩下的都是智商税。华为和赛力斯真是把消费者当韭菜割。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_062", "text": "理性分析：儿童车定价高，但包含品牌授权、设计、安全认证等成本，且市场定位高端，存在合理溢价。建议等官方公布详细配置再评价。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_063", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福。但15800对普通家庭来说太贵了，希望官方能出平价版。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_064", "text": "15800？不如买辆二手QQ，还能上路。这儿童车是给娃开还是给爹开？", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_065", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，是不是在利用家长的攀比心理？这种风气不可长，建议监管部门关注定价合理性。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}]}
